TI  - Design and Application of a Virtual Simulation System Based on Wireless Sensor Networks
T2  - 2024 IEEE 16TH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON COMPUTATIONAL INTELLIGENCE AND COMMUNICATION NETWORKS, CICN
M3  - Proceedings Paper
CP  - 16th International Conference on Computational Intelligence and Communication Networks
